(text "U401 I2C address is 0x21 (A2:A1:A0 = 001); the existing keypad expander U4 remains at 0x20. Poll both card detect inputs." (at 16 91.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 8c1be6de-cb4c-5f4c-85fc-cb93a7004a3e))
(text "For the 3.4-inch ST7701S, bit-bang the 9-bit setup via P00/P01/P02. The 4-inch panel uses its module defaults. Pixel data uses RGB565." (at 16 96.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 68a94970-bf99-5527-82fa-0f5d0a5e0c31))
(text "The expander resets to inputs with weak pull-ups. Apply external safe-state pulls at the LCD and camera before enabling outputs." (at 16 101.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid e26f42a2-0622-513f-8cb5-9ebc49f99b3b))
(text "Write output-latch safe levels first, then direction. U4 CAM_ENABLE controls DOVDD. U401 CAM_ANALOG_ENABLE controls the subsequent 2.8 V rail." (at 16 106.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid dc139003-061e-59cc-a926-a7904d779365))
